vielotus (2.0.10-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.10:
    - VNI alphanumeric, mixed-case, and digit-bridge parity across Swift 6 and
      C++20 (leading digits, phonotactics, 1-step Tone-Replace Rollback,
      literal desktop Numpad 0-9, and mixed-case compounds such as
      TPĐạt123TPĐạt123ĐạtTP123 while preserving English CamelCase+digits,
      hardware acronyms, passwords, and P0.6 repeated-digit escapes).
    - Windows TSF reliability: fix cross-process Telex/VNI Taskbar switching,
      restore [V]/[E] LangBar badge, prevent duplicate MSIX/Store entries,
      hot-reload macros.json, and drop Ctrl+Shift+S hijack.
    - macOS & Linux polish: clean ESC passthrough in macOS overlays, IBus/Fcitx5
      preedit/numpad/modifier fixes, and headless Debian DEP-8 autopkgtest gate.

