vielotus (2.0.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.8:
    - Core engine parity (Swift 6 and C++20): support circumflex/horn
      updates across semivowels, Central Highlands place names (Dak Lak,
      Krong Pac) while preserving English kr- words, and refined Telex
      context-sensitive lexicon rules.
    - Windows TSF refactor: split Settings/Tray/Feedback UI out of
      VieLotusTIP.dll into out-of-process VieLotusSettings.exe with a
      session-scoped Named Pipe wake channel for AppContainer hosts,
      Taskbar [V]/[E] indicator, and cleaner AV hygiene.
    - macOS InputMethodKit: Hybrid Pure Native presentation policy and
      main-thread TISCreateInputSourceList safety.
    - Add freestanding C++20 WebAssembly SDK (@vielotus/core).

