vielotus (2.0.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 2.0.7:
    - Windows TSF full multi-architecture compatibility: build ARM64X
      dual-ABI (ARM64 + ARM64EC) VieLotusTIP.dll for native ARM64 and
      emulated x64 apps on Windows 11 ARM64, plus 32-bit WOW64
      VieLotusTIP32.dll registered under WOW6432Node so 32-bit x86 apps
      (e.g. Zalo PC, Steam, legacy Win32) load VieLotusIM cleanly on both
      Windows x64 and ARM64.
    - AV-hygienic Windows installers: eliminate embedded secondary PE
      payloads and LOLBin invocations (icacls, rundll32, hidden PowerShell)
      in favor of native Win32 Security/COM provisioning.

